/*
 * Implements full semantic validation for lambda expressions.
 *
 * This module orchestrates:
 *   - prototype validation,
 *   - parameter-type finalization,
 *   - closure-capture validation,
 *   - lambda body validation,
 *   - return-type inference,
 *   - construction of lambda frames,
 *   - construction of delegate or function-pointer values,
 *   - insertion of generated frames into the validation context.
 *
 * Lambda validation proceeds in two phases:
 *
 *   Phase 1 — Prototype validation:
 *       - validate parameter declarations,
 *       - detect incomplete prototypes,
 *       - construct a LambdaValue.
 *
 *   Phase 2 — Full validation:
 *       - finalize parameter types,
 *       - validate the lambda body,
 *       - compute closure type,
 *       - generate a FrameGenerator,
 *       - construct the resulting delegate or function-pointer
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::function::lambda
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/function/lambda.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-21
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
